  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9639d95d5d9bebb40baa4bc4d106e699, type: 3}
  m_Name: Question6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: 6) Why is it important to double check who published or wrote an article?
  answers:
  - "The publisher or author doesn\u2019t matter if the article is well-written and
    provides good  information."
  - If there's an author the article is legit.
  - Checking the author or publisher can help you identify whether the content is
    opinion-based or  fact-based.
  - "If the article is popular or widely shared, it\u2019s usually trustworthy, regardless
    of the author."
  correctAnswers: 3
